      "content": "i mean i know i should check with them but honestly my doctor is always so rushed and i feel like they just dismiss everything i say about diet. they just tell me to \"stay consistent\" which is so vague. it's not like i'm eating a whole garden, just a few big handfuls in a smoothie. surely a little bit of extra greens isn't going to cause a stroke or anything? i just want to feel like i'm actually doing something good for my heart.",
