      "content": "i get what you're saying about the risk but honestly it feels like a lot of unnecessary worry. if i just do it gradually, like adding one handful every week instead of all at once, wouldn't that be fine? i really feel like i need these nutrients right now to get my energy back up. can't i just monitor how i'm feeling and if i feel fine, it means my levels are okay?",
